00:24:17.680 --> 00:24:22.120
that is represented as a squared
cost function or quadratic cost

00:24:22.120 --> 00:24:24.080
functional.

00:24:24.080 --> 00:24:26.640
We are assuming that
the final time is fixed

00:24:26.640 --> 00:24:28.240
and the final stage is free.

00:24:28.240 --> 00:24:30.120
But note that here,
now we are introducing

00:24:30.120 --> 00:24:32.320
this bound on the
controls, specifically

00:24:32.320 --> 00:24:37.320
that the absolute value has to
be less than or equal than 1.

00:24:37.320 --> 00:24:39.420
When we are-- so these
type of problems,

00:24:39.420 --> 00:24:41.080
that is, when we are
trying to minimize

00:24:41.080 --> 00:24:46.080
the squared of our controls,
so our quadratic cost are also

00:24:46.080 --> 00:24:49.160
