01:07:35.840 --> 01:07:36.520
All right.

01:07:36.520 --> 01:07:38.600
Thank you.

01:07:38.600 --> 01:07:40.080
Would this have
the singular arcs

01:07:40.080 --> 01:07:42.880
where obviously still the
0 case but also when they

01:07:42.880 --> 01:07:44.460
equal to ci and negative ci?

01:07:44.460 --> 01:07:45.420
Yes, indeed.

01:07:45.420 --> 01:07:48.480
Here, we are assuming that
our optimal control does not

01:07:48.480 --> 01:07:50.600
fall into these conditions.

01:07:50.600 --> 01:07:52.280
Yeah.

01:07:52.280 --> 01:07:56.200
Conceptually, I'm wondering, in
the bang-off-bang bang control

01:07:56.200 --> 01:07:58.920
sequence, is there
something in those terms

01:07:58.920 --> 01:08:03.160
that also weighs total time?

01:08:03.160 --> 01:08:05.520
Or is it purely just
